    IF `the person was required to pay an employer's premium in 2011`
    THEN `the amount of the employer's premium in 2011`
    ELSE 0

-- src:1571 | (8.91) If an employer’s premium is $10,000 or less for 2011, the Minister shall refund to the employer a portion of the premium for 2012 determined by the following formula if that amount is more than $2:
