    IF     `P1 as subsection (8.95) sets it` AT MOST 15_000
       AND `s 96(10) the application for the refund is made in time` `the application is made in writing to the Minister` 2013 `the day on which the application is made`
    THEN `ei3 the refund` (`ei3 the refund of` (`P2, the amount of the employer's premium in 2013` MINUS `P1 as subsection (8.95) sets it`) `if it is more than` 2)
