       AND `s 96(10) the application for the refund is made in time` `the application is made in writing to the Minister` 2016 `the day on which the application is made`
    THEN `ei3 the refund of` (`E, the total of all insurable earnings paid in 2016 by the employer for which premiums were deductible` TIMES (0.28%) TIMES 1.4) `if it is more than` 2
